  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Conservation of Critically Endangered Leatherback and Hawksbill Marine Turtles on.Nicaraguas Pacific Coast</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will monitor and protect leatherback and hawksbill nesting populations through community protection strategies at Asseradores, Veracruz, Salamina, and Estero Padre Ramos, strengthen coastal management and protection of nesting sites at Salamina, Veracruz, and Estero Padre Ramos by raising awareness of policy makers and local stakeholders and by implementing a National Sea Turtle Campaign at the nesting beaches, and develop a conservation tourism program at Estero Padre Ramos.</narrative>
  </description>
